# 锐捷设备 show int des 命令解析模板
# 获取端口名称、操作状态(Status)、管理状态(Administrative)、描述
# 输出格式为固定列宽：
# Interface (32字符) | Status (8字符) | Administrative (14字符) | Description
#
# 示例输出：
# Interface                        Status   Administrative Description
# -------------------------------- -------- -------------- -----------
# FastEthernet 1/0                 up       up             connect  XianTao-SW01
# FastEthernet 1/1                 down     down
# GigabitEthernet 0/0              up       up             connect to DX_MSTP
# VLAN 10                          up       up

Value Required INTERFACE (.{32})
Value Required STATUS (\S+)
Value Required ADMINISTRATIVE (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Administrative\s+Description
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${ADMINISTRATIVE}\s*${DESCRIPTION} -> Record
